<title>UKRAINE: TABLE-Ukraine July unemployment rises to 1.98 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ukraine July unemployment rises to 1.98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Ukraine rose to 1.98 percent of the labour force in July, or 542,550 unemployed, from 1.90 percent in June, or 520,592 unemployed,</p>
<p>the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p> UKRAINIAN UNEMPLOYMENT  July 97    Jun 97    July 96</p>
<p> number of unemployed    542,550    520,592   229,300</p>
<p> pct of workforce	  1.98	 1.90	n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Official information in Ukraine, with a population of 50-51 million people, tends to understate unemployment levels.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
</text>
